      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "About Alert Acquirer",
      "id": "about",
      "intro": "Alert Acquirer adalah modul untuk memonitor dan mengelola alert fraud yang dihasilkan dari transaksi acquirer. Dilengkapi dengan klasifikasi tab, advanced search, lock/unlock, bulk operations, discussion, action request, dan transaction history.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa itu Alert Acquirer?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Monitor alert fraud dari sisi acquirer secara real-time\n• 4 tab klasifikasi: **All**, **Not Fraud** (NEGATIVE), **Suspicious**, **Fraud** (POSITIVE)\n• Tabel berisi kolom: Alert Name, Status (Classified/Not Classified), Amount, Response Code\n• Klik baris alert untuk membuka detail drawer\n• Toggle **Current List** / **Historical List** di toolbar",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
